    "body": "@zcorpan Especially if people are wanting me to cache the promise, then what I need is some kind of hook for \"current request changes\". Then we can be sure to reset the promise whenever the current request changes. If current request is sometimes replaced and sometimes mutated in-place, this seems especially hard.\r\n\r\nHopefully you can help out with that as part of fixing #1055 :)",
